{"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/CommunityDetection\/documentation\/CommunityDetection"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@frozen"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"LouvainEvent"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"G"},{"kind":"text","text":"> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"G"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"DirectedGraph","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols08DirectedA0P","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each level starts with local moving: level vertices are taken in number order, sweep after"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sweep, and each moves to the neighboring community that raises the modularity most, reported"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as it moves. Communities are named by level vertex numbers. When a sweep moves nothing the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"level is finished, with its partition of the graph’s vertices and that partition’s modularity."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"While the modularity rose by more than the threshold, the communities are then merged into the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"next level’s vertices, numbered by their labels in the partition just reported. At the first"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"level the level vertices are the graph’s vertices, numbered in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" order (their vertex"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"indices when the graph has them). The method ends after a level whose modularity did not rise"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"enough, or after an aggregation whose local moving moved nothing."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/communitydetection\/louvainevent"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/CommunityDetection\/documentation\/CommunityDetection\/LouvainEvent","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/CommunityDetection\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/CommunityDetection\/s23CustomStringConvertibleP","doc:\/\/CommunityDetection\/SQ","doc:\/\/CommunityDetection\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/CommunityDetection\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/CommunityDetection\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo"}],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:18CommunityDetection12LouvainEventO","remoteSource":{"fileName":"LouvainEvents.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/CommunityDetection\/LouvainEvents.swift#L15"},"symbolKind":"enum","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"LouvainEvent","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"CommunityDetection"}],"roleHeading":"Enumeration","title":"LouvainEvent","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"LouvainEvent","kind":"identifier"}]},"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Enumeration Cases","identifiers":["doc:\/\/CommunityDetection\/documentation\/CommunityDetection\/LouvainEvent\/aggregate(vertexCount:)","doc:\/\/CommunityDetection\/documentation\/CommunityDetection\/LouvainEvent\/levelFinished(_:modularity:)","doc:\/\/CommunityDetection\/documentation\/CommunityDetection\/LouvainEvent\/move(_:from:to:gain:)"],"anchor":"Enumeration-Cases"},{"generated":true,"title":"Default Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/CommunityDetection\/documentation\/CommunityDetection\/Lou